entity.description:
A record a mail client message (moqui.basic.email.EmailMessage) is to be filed on once it is sent: the
            Compose "File on" chip of a draft, a scheduled send or one held for undo or waiting in the Outbox after a failed
            send. mantle.party.CommunicationServices.send#EmailDraft writes it after checking the user sees the record;
            when the message reaches ES_SENT, file#SentEmail files it (link#CommunicationEventRecord with the
            emailMessageId) and deletes the row. No foreign key to the message, so the mail client deletes a draft freely;
            the message's delete ECA removes its rows.
